## Objective
- Conduct passive security reconnaissance of Spare Labs' in-scope infrastructure (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com) and identify vulnerabilities for bug bounty reporting.
