## Important Details
- Scope: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. ALL OTHER subdomains excluded. Third-party services excluded.
- Passive-first only: GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification. Secrets in commits: sha256 only.
- Fleet: 7 prod hosts (api.{sparelabs.com, us, us2, us3, jp, eu}), plus UAT (api.uat.sparelabs.com — bypass parity LOST). Multi-version envoy LB confirmed behind `server: envoy; via: 1.1 google`.
