## Objective
- Passive reconnaissance and vulnerability enumeration of Spare's in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com) for bug bounty reporting.
