## Important Details
- **Scope**: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. ALL other subdomains are OUT OF SCOPE.
- **Rules**: Passive-first only (GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps), no account creation, no data modification. Secrets in commits use sha256 only.
- **Architecture**: api.sparelabs.com sits behind envoy edge gateway + Google CDN; multi-version LB serves different code versions across replicas (fast vs slow). Multi-host fleet: prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat (8 hosts total, UAT parity now lost).
- **Patch/Revert cycle**: Vendor deployed fix ~2026-08-20 then FULLY REVERTED fleet-wide by 2026-08-21. All pre-patch findings restored. "longcat triage PATCHED" (2026-08-11) was a false positive (only tested no-auth path, missed Bearer-x vector).
- **Staging divergence**: api.staging.sparelabs.com has newer code (regions=401 enforced, workos=401 enforced) — confirms prod serves older vulnerable code via multi-version LB.

