Here's a concise summary of everything that has been done so far:

## What We've Done (Aug 7 - Aug 22, 2026)

### Project
Passive security reconnaissance for the **Spare Bug Bounty** program targeting `spare.com` / `sparelabs.com` in-scope assets.

### Phase 1: Initial Recon (Aug 7)
- Enumerated 6 in-scope assets; confirmed `api.sparelabs.com` exposes a large `/v1/` API surface
- Discovered 3 initial findings: CORS credential reflection, auth bypass on `/v1/global/regions`, UUID enumeration oracle

### Phase 2: Deep Validation (Aug 7-9)
- **~400 triage runs** across 5+ AI models (mimo, nemotron3, bigpickle, laguna, ling3, longcat)
- Validated **7 accepted findings** (A1-A7) with hundreds of live probe samples
- All findings confirmed STABLE with sha256 body hashes for reproducibility

### Phase 3: Extended Monitoring (Aug 10-21)
- Tracked a **vendor patch/revert cycle**: fix deployed ~Aug 20, **fully reverted** fleet-wide by Aug 21
- Identified **SURVIVOR classes** (never patched) and **REVERTED classes** (patched then rolled back)
- Discovered new findings: WorkOS SSO tenant oracle, engage chain auth bypass, org-key enumeration

### Final Accepted Findings (7 high/medium + survivors)

| # | Finding | CVSS | Status |
|---|---------|------|--------|
| A1 | CORS reflect-any-origin+creds on `/v1/**` | 8.1 HIGH | STABLE |
| A2 | Scheme-only auth bypass `/v1/global/regions` | 5.3 MED | STABLE |
| A3 | UUID enumeration oracle `/v1/public/organization` | 5.3 MED | STABLE |
| A4 | `/v1/global/organizations` fail-open (zero-header) | 5.3 MED | STABLE |
| A5 | `/v1/public/terms` data disclosure | 5.3 MED | STABLE |
| A6 | CSP infra leak `platform.sparelabs.com` | 3.1 LOW | STABLE |
| A7 | JS bundle staging infra leak `forms.sparelabs.com` | 3.1 LOW | STABLE |

**Post-revert survivors** (Aug 21): WorkOS SSO oracle, engage chain, org-key oracle all confirmed alive.

### Current Blockers
- **GitHub repo scan**: misconfigured target (scans `gladiaio` instead of `sparelabs`) — 0 hits across all sessions
- **AUTH_HELPED** needed for: engage write exploitation, WorkOS OAuth callback chain, admin portal access
- **Report submission**: needs canonical hash rebuild from evidence artifacts

